     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Obligation, permission and recommendation",
     "texto": [
      "The forms **można**, **należy** and **warto** allow instructions to be given without naming a particular person. **Nie wolno** expresses a prohibition.",
      "The infinitive that follows these forms does not change: **można oddać**, **należy wypełnić**, **warto sprawdzić**. Adjust the force of the instruction to the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
